<title>POLAND: FarmFood Q1 net falls to PLN 1.2 mln.</title>
<headline>FarmFood Q1 net falls to PLN 1.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farm Food SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			3.73  vs    6.08</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  2.35  vs    4.63</p>
<p>    net profit				1.23  vs    3.43</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Farm Food SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				57.00  vs   47.97</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 49.45  vs   40.20</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.01  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				1.12  vs    1.21</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.76  vs    0.91</p>
<p>    financial costs			 2.14  vs    2.35</p>
<p>    investment			     10.39  vs    5.83</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
